<Docs title="Doctor" description="Run puck doctor before switching a project from Composer.">
  <h1>Doctor</h1>
  <p>
    Preflight for the current project. Run it before you switch from Composer.
    Exit non-zero when there is a blocker.
  </p>
  <pre><code>puck doctor
puck doctor --json</code></pre>

  <h2>What it checks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Unsupported Composer plugins (Tier 3 refusal)</li>
    <li>Repository types beyond Composer + path (0.2)</li>
    <li>Abandoned packages and platform hints (warnings)</li>
    <li>Store path info</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Example</h2>
  <pre><code>$ puck doctor
project: acme/app

blocker  unsupported plugin  foo/bar-installer
warning  abandoned package   old/lib
warning  platform php        ^8.2 (host 8.4.23)
info     store               ~/.puck/store

1 blocker</code></pre>
  <p>Warnings do not block. Fix blockers, or stay on Composer for that project.</p>
</Docs>
